 "lines": {"toy_seesaw_heave_the_end_up": ["Up it goes. Everything I do is a lift. Nobody's grateful.", "Heave. Ho. Heave. Ho. Worth nothing, as usual."], "toy_seesaw_shift_weight_on_the_brace": ["It creaks. I creak. We're equals, really.", "That's an old noise. I like old noises."], "toy_seesaw_sulk_on_the_base": ["Seesaw for two. Cheese for one. Maths isn't my problem.", "Don't look at me. I'm the base now."], "toy_seesaw_wait_for_a_partner": ["Two seats. One duck. The maths is rude.", "Nobody's coming. I know. I'm waiting out of spite."], "toy_seesaw_present_to_a_buyer": ["Fully functional. Both ends. Previous owner: nobody, so, mint condition.", "Do I sound like a salesman? Good. Buy it."], "toy_seesaw_argue_with_the_brace": ["I've got three feet of plank and no authority. Welcome to my life.", "The brace started it. It looked at me. Rude."], "toy_seesaw_kick_the_snow_bank": ["Kicked a snowbank. Felt something. Not sure what. Probably spite.", "Winter's just stationary water. Can still be kicked."], "toy_seesaw_hush_the_wet_hinge": ["Shut up, hinge. I've got more rust than you and I'm not squeaking.", "Quiet now. Good. Back to being furniture."], "toy_seesaw_clipped_by_the_drop": ["OW. Shit. Okay. Zero stars, would touch again.", "Head versus plank. Plank wins. Plank always wins."], "toy_seesaw_skid_on_the_wet_base": ["The base is wet. I am now also wet. Fair is fair.", "Slid. Landed. Pretended it was a plan."], "toy_seesaw_flipped_by_the_rebound": ["Went up. Came down. Sat there. Learned nothing, which is on brand.", "I was airborne. For a second. Most dignified second of my day."], "toy_seesaw_stuck_under_the_plank": ["Fitted yesterday. Fitted before breakfast. The seesaw has grown.", "Stuck again. Tell nobody. I'm busy."]},
